<title>DENMARK: Royal Copenhagen H1 1996/97 profit rises.</title>
<headline>Royal Copenhagen H1 1996/97 profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to March 31 1997</p>
<p>					  (million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Pre-tax result		96.3  vs   84.1</p>
<p> Operating result	   100.0  vs   78.6</p>
<p> Turnover		     984.8  vs  961.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of upmarket Danish porcelain, glass and silverware group is Royal Copenhagen A/S. It is 82 percent owned by brewer Carlsberg. It said in a statement on Wednesday that it maintained an earlier forecast of stable development for the full year with the possibility of improvement, given positive market conditions. --Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33-969650</p>
</text>
